oncert with a story that unfolds the artist's universe like a movie. \n - Our performance directing optimized for the VR environment and stereoscopic CG \nare offered to provide an extra special experience that is only achievable at VR concerts which is going beyond a normal offline concert. \n\nEnjoy a real offline concert with our '3D VR LIVE Concert' feature to experience the sense of presence at your house. \n- You will be able to enjoy your favorite artist\u2019s World Tour Concerts at your house with our 8K 3D VR LIVE Concert feature. \n- Wherever you are, all you need is your VR device to transform your surroundings into a concert hall. \n\nArtist Showroom \n- You can walk around and check out the 6dof metaverse space filled with your favorite artist and the performance-related content. ", "short_description": "Enjoy your favorite artist's performance with an immersive feeling from our 8K 3D VR high-definition videos. \nYou will be able to enjoy the performance without motion sickness even after watching it for a long time. \nExperience the immersive feeling as if you are looking at your favorite artist right in front of you making eye contacts.  "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ventavr.com/doc/private", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VENTA VR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://venta-x.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME", "MUSIC", "MUSIC_VIDEO"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_pl